{
  "id": "meta-debate",
  "name": "meta-debate",
  "description": "Meta-intelligence: proposer answers, an adversarial challenger attacks the answer (flaws, counterexamples, missing cases), then the proposer concedes-or-rebuts point by point and writes the defended final answer. Multi-agent debate pattern; comparable 1:1 against an isolated LLM call.",
